< ::The lack of government is a result of the affirmation of the non-aggression principle, i.e., the initiation of violence by individuals is opposed, but defensive violence is affirmed. An individual&amp;#39;s allegience to or membership in any organization including government does not obviate this principle. As a result, all government relying on the initiation of force, as all current forms do, is excluded.
